    rdf:value """Saturday, June 17, I Tatti
G[eoffrey] S[cott] N[aima] L[öfroth]
Scirocco
A quiet day such as I like and corrected proofs - and Geoffrey, who wastes too much time! Since M[arcella] M[ichela] came on the scene he has really form rather slack. BB had tea with Sybil, and Geoffrey and I walked on Monte Senario. Sybil is still going on about Nora’s visit. Lucky she doesn’t know about this silly ugly business with Miss Belle Greene. """^^xsd:string ;
